      "page": 16,
      "quote": "this study proposes a PGC segmentation method to enhance the grayscale contrast in the images.",
      "statement": "Mura研究使用分段伽马校正增强灰度对比，服务于缺陷检测。",
      "review_status": "SOURCE_VERIFIED",
      "authority_type": "PUBLIC_RESEARCH"
    },
    {
      "id": "CL_PGC_APSO",
      "subject": "METHOD_PGC",
