      "page": 1,
      "quote": "Firstly, the salient color channel in RGBY is selected by the maximum relative entropy criterion",
      "statement": "方法通过最大相对熵准则选择RGBY显著颜色通道。",
      "review_status": "SOURCE_VERIFIED",
      "authority_type": "PUBLIC_RESEARCH"
